{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったかた\nニコ生見てくださったかた\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「部活何やってたの？」\nって質問が何回かあったんだけど\n今日のために内緒にしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです、\n何を隠そうこの私\n中学の３年間バトン部でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その頃よりは\nだいぶできなくなっちゃったけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばりました｀・ω・´"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/rock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田とかただのヲタクじゃないんです。\n動けるヲタクなんです(￣＾￣)\nん？\n動けるアイドルなんです(￣＾￣)\nあれ？・ｏ・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはさておき\nダンスいかがでしたか？\n緊張しすぎて\n間違えてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/typhoon.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの前で\n披露できるものじゃなくて\n反省点はかなりあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それなのに\n暖かく見守っていただき\n本当にありがとうございましたヽ(；；)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとサイリウム高まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくngngの帰りに幕張メッセの横で\n暗い中、焚いて打ってるのを見るのが\n好きでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっかのイルミネーションよりも\n全然きれい(´｀*)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後もどうか\n応援のほどよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/30/111129_212301.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑囲まれて2828してる中田。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もなかなかダッ!!\nなかだかなでした～☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}